---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../data/site-config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kit-Bin"
  description="What happens to your files on Kit-Bin, what data is and isn't collected, and how Google AdSense uses cookies on this site."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Your files</h2>
      <p>
        Every tool on this site currently processes files entirely in your browser, using
        WebAssembly and native browser APIs. Your file is read into your browser's memory, the
        conversion runs on your device, and the result downloads directly to your device. At no
        point is a file you select uploaded to any server. This applies to every tool currently
        live on the site — none of them use a server fallback. If that changes for a specific
        tool in the future (for very large files or a format that genuinely can't be processed
        client-side), that tool's own page will say so explicitly.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Accounts and storage</h2>
      <p>
        There are no user accounts on this site. Nothing you upload or convert is stored on any
        server, ever — there's no database for user files.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not currently run any analytics or tracking script. If aggregate,
        cookieless usage analytics (page views, general device/location category — not
        individual tracking) are added in the future, this section will be updated to say so
        before that happens.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site is supported by Google AdSense. Google may use cookies and similar
        technologies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can review
        and control the data Google uses for ad personalization at
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="underline">Google Ads Settings</a>, and
        learn more about how Google uses data at
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="underline"
          >How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
